[sliver] Unavoidable fitted snap lips: each wing's lip reaches the faucet display cover's 1.2 mm engagement. Its retention face is that 1.2 mm, flat and square to the push, and bears on the rib window's bearing face; its 0.9 mm straight tip, between that face and the 30° lead-in ramp, is what rides the rib's flank going on.
alternatives: A deeper engagement spreads each wing past the faucet cover's strain on the same beam estimate, and a shallower one holds less. Running the ramp down to the retention face leaves a knife edge at the tip.
