[sliver] Specific flexure: each strip is the top of a 1.5 mm spring wing, the thickness that keeps its peak strain going on at the faucet display cover's (1.76% against 1.77% on one beam estimate).
alternatives: A thicker wing strains more for the same spread. A longer one needs the face the rib roots on further from the tube than the ceiling over carb-1 stands.
