[thin] Specific flexure: the cap's two spring wings are 1.5 mm thick from the round end of each wing gap to their tops; the faucet display cover's accepted wings are 1.35 mm. Everything else in the cap is the solid saddle round the bore.
alternatives: A thicker wing strains more going on, past the faucet cover's on the same estimate. Filling the gap stiffens the wing's root, which then takes the whole bend over a shorter length.
